  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Interpreting \"Metode Ini\"**\n\nI\'m trying to figure out what \"metode ini\" refers to in the user\'s message, \"Bisa lanjutkan metode ini?\". Based on the context from `DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.md`, I believe \"metode ini\" relates to the prototype\'s development, specifically the tasks described in the document: Home, Check 3 Drug Labels, Drug Cabinet, and Dictionary, within the first stage. I need to clarify if the user wants to continue developing this prototype, or the construction advice.\n\n\n**Defining Next Steps**\n\nI\'ve got a clearer picture of what the next modules entail: Branching Scenarios, Flashcards, and Pre/Post-test quizzes. The \"LatihanPreviewView.tsx\" file provides helpful details, confirming that these modules are the planned continuation of the prototype\'s first stage. I am now focused on defining how these integrate with the initial modules.\n\n\n"
