  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Onboarding**\n\nI\'m focusing on crafting a smooth onboarding experience for `BerandaView`. The current direction involves a banner or trigger to initiate a step-by-step spotlight, considering the mobile-first and desktop layout constraints. I am thinking of the cleanest way to introduce the interactive tooltips.\n\n\n**Implementing the Walkthrough**\n\nI\'m now building `BerandaWalkthrough.tsx`. I\'ve decided to include a compact \"Panduan Fitur\" button in the Hero section of Beranda. This will trigger the interactive Walkthrough Bar, highlighting sections, with smooth scrolling, and an anchored tooltip. The goal is to provide a reliable experience across screen sizes. The main focus will be the initial 4-step interactive walkthrough, including a simulation of a \"Cek Label Obat\" step.\n\n\n**Defining the Next Steps**\n\nNow, I\'m defining the next steps in the walkthrough: visualizing medication stock and expiry information in \"Lemari Obat Saya,\" followed by scenario-based learning with flashcards and quizzes, then concluding with access to a dictionary and official references. I\'m focusing on ensuring all the content is accessible on tablets, syrups and ointments, as well as considering how to implement contextual information tooltips, triggered by a question mark, on key Beranda cards.\n\n\n**Refining Button Interactions**\n\nI\'m refining the button interactions within the Beranda cards to avoid invalid HTML and improve accessibility. The initial approach of nested buttons triggered warnings. Now, I\'m using relative container `<div>` elements with the card\'s main button and the tooltip trigger as siblings, positioned absolutely in the top-right corner. This avoids nested buttons, is accessible, and handles both mobile taps and desktop hover/clicks cleanly.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7261383152627350031"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState, useEffect, useRef } from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  Compass,\\n  X,\\n  ChevronLeft,\\n  ChevronRight,\\n  CheckCircle2,\\n  HelpCircle,\\n  ScanSearch,\\n  Archive,\\n  Dumbbell,\\n  BookOpen,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\nexport interface WalkthroughStep {\\n  id: \'cek-label\' | \'lemari-stok\' | \'latihan\' | \'belajar-cepat\';\\n  stepNumber: number;\\n  title: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  tip: string;\\n  icon: React.ElementType;\\n  accentBg: string;\\n  accentText: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport const WALKTHROUGH_STEPS: WalkthroughStep[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'cek-label\',\\n    stepNumber: 1,\\n    title: \'Simulasi Cek Label Obat\',\\n    description:\\n      \'Ketuk 6 titik kritis pada kemasan Tablet, Sirup, dan Salep untuk mengenali arti logo golongan, aturan pakai, tanggal kedaluwarsa, hingga kode NIE BPOM.\',\\n    tip: \'Mulai dari sini jika Anda belum terbiasa membaca etiket obat kemasan.\',\\n    icon: ScanSearch,\\n    accentBg: \'bg-teal-100\',\\n    accentText: \'text-teal-800\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'lemari-stok\',\\n    stepNumber: 2,\\n    title: \'Lemari Obat & Grafik Stok\',\\n    description:\\n      \'Catat obat yang tersimpan di rumah. Grafik otomatis mengelompokkan status Aman, Segera Kedaluwarsa (\342\211\244 30 hari), dan Kedaluwarsa agar mudah dipantau.\',\\n    tip: \'Klik salah satu warna di grafik untuk langsung menyaring daftar obat.\',\\n    icon: Archive,\\n    accentBg: \'bg-emerald-100\',\\n    accentText: \'text-emerald-800\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'latihan\',\\n    stepNumber: 3,\\n    title: \'Skenario Kasus, Flashcard & Kuis\',\\n    description:\\n      \'Latih pengambilan keputusan swamedikasi lewat cerita bercabang, hafalkan istilah dengan Flashcard 3D, dan ukur pemahaman lewat Kuis Pre/Post-Test.\',\\n    tip: \'Semua jawaban kuis disertai alasan ilmiah dari pedoman resmi.\',\\n    icon: Dumbbell,\\n    accentBg: \'bg-indigo-100\',\\n    accentText: \'text-indigo-800\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'belajar-cepat\',\\n    stepNumber: 4,\\n    title: \'Kamus Istilah & Pustaka Resmi\',\\n    description:\\n      \'Temukan arti istilah seperti BUD, Exp. Date, dan P.No 1\342\200\2236 di Kamus Label Obat, serta lihat sumber rujukan Kemenkes RI & BPOM di tab Pustaka.\',\\n    tip: \'Gunakan tombol \\\"Panduan Fitur\\\" di atas kapan saja untuk memutar ulang tur ini.\',\\n    icon: BookOpen,\\n    accentBg: \'bg-amber-100\',\\n    accentText: \'text-amber-800\',\\n  },\\n];\\n\\ninterface BerandaWalkthroughProps {\\n  isActive: boolean;\\n  currentStepIndex: number;\\n  onNext: () => void;\\n  onPrev: () => void;\\n  onSelectStep: (index: number) => void;\\n  onClose: () => void;\\n  onJumpToFeature?: (stepId: WalkthroughStep[\'id\']) => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const BerandaWalkthrough: React.FC<BerandaWalkthroughProps> = ({\\n  isActive,\\n  currentStepIndex,\\n  onNext,\\n  onPrev,\\n  onSelectStep,\\n  onClose,\\n  onJumpToFeature,\\n}) => {\\n  if (!isActive) return null;\\n\\n  const step = WALKTHROUGH_STEPS[currentStepIndex];\\n  const Icon = step.icon;\\n  const isFirst = currentStepIndex === 0;\\n  const isLast = currentStepIndex === WALKTHROUGH_STEPS.length - 1;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section\\n      aria-label=\\\"Panduan Interaktif Fitur Beranda\\\"\\n      className=\\\"ro-fade-in rounded-2xl bg-white border-2 border-teal-600/80 shadow-md p-4 sm:p-5 space-y-4 relative overflow-hidden\\\"\\n    >\\n      {/* Top Progress Strip */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-teal-700 text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\\\">\\n            <Compass className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-teal-800 block leading-none\\\">\\n              Panduan Pengguna Baru\\n            </span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\\\">\\n              Langkah {step.stepNumber} dari {WALKTHROUGH_STEPS.length}\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          onClick={onClose}\\n          className=\\\"min-h-[36px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          aria-label=\\\"Tutup panduan fitur\\\"\\n        >\\n          <span>Lewati</span>\\n          <X className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Step Content */}\\n      <div className=\\\"p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 flex items-start gap-3.5\\\">\\n        <div className={`w-10 h-10 rounded-xl ${step.accentBg} ${step.accentText} flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5`}>\\n          <Icon className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n        </div>\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-1.5 flex-1 min-w-0\\\">\\n          <h3 className=\\\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n            {step.title}\\n          </h3>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n            {step.description}\\n          </p>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-teal-800 font-medium bg-teal-50/90 border border-teal-200/70 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1.5\\\">\\n            Tips: {step.tip}\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Step Dots & Controls */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-1\\\">\\n        {/* Step Indicator Dots */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\" role=\\\"tablist\\\" aria-label=\\\"Pilih langkah panduan\\\">\\n          {WALKTHROUGH_STEPS.map((s, idx) => {\\n            const active = idx === currentStepIndex;\\n            return (\\n              <button\\n                key={s.id}\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                role=\\\"tab\\\"\\n                aria-selected={active}\\n                aria-label={`Langkah ${idx + 1}: ${s.title}`}\\n                onClick={() => onSelectStep(idx)}\\n                className={`h-2.5 rounded-full transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n                  active ? \'w-7 bg-teal-700\' : \'w-2.5 bg-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-400\'\\n                }`}\\n              />\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Action Buttons */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-end gap-2 flex-wrap\\\">\\n          {onJumpToFeature && (\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => onJumpToFeature(step.id)}\\n              className=\\\"min-h-[40px] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-teal-50 hover:bg-teal-100 text-teal-800 border border-teal-200 text-xs font-bold transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              Coba Fitur Ini\\n            </button>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {!isFirst && (\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={onPrev}\\n              className=\\\"min-h-[40px] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              <ChevronLeft className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n              <span>Sebelumnya</span>\\n            </button>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {!isLast ? (\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={onNext}\\n              className=\\\"min-h-[40px] px-4 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-teal-700 hover:bg-teal-800 text-white text-xs font-bold flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer shadow-xs\\\"\\n            >\\n              <span>Berikutnya</span>\\n              <ChevronRight className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n          ) : (\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={onClose}\\n              className=\\\"min-h-[40px] px-4 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white text-xs font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer shadow-xs\\\"\\n            >\\n              <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n              <span>Selesai</span>\\n            </button>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\ninterface FeatureTooltipProps {\\n  title: string;\\n  content: string;\\n  align?: \'left\' | \'right\';\\n}\\n\\nexport const FeatureTooltip: React.FC<FeatureTooltipProps> = ({\\n  title,\\n  content,\\n  align = \'right\',\\n}) => {\\n  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const wrapperRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!isOpen) return;\\n\\n    const handleClickOutside = (event: MouseEvent) => {\\n      if (wrapperRef.current && !wrapperRef.current.contains(event.target as Node)) {\\n        setIsOpen(false);\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    const handleKeyDown = (event: KeyboardEvent) => {\\n      if (event.key === \'Escape\') {\\n        setIsOpen(false);\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    document.addEventListener(\'mousedown\', handleClickOutside);\\n    document.addEventListener(\'keydown\', handleKeyDown);\\n    return () => {\\n      document.removeEventListener(\'mousedown\', handleClickOutside);\\n      document.removeEventListener(\'keydown\', handleKeyDown);\\n    };\\n  }, [isOpen]);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div ref={wrapperRef} className=\\\"relative inline-flex items-center\\\">\\n      <button\\n        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n        onClick={() => setIsOpen((prev) => !prev)}\\n        aria-expanded={isOpen}\\n        aria-label={`Info fitur: ${title}`}\\n        className={`w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-colors cursor-pointer focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-600 ${\\n          isOpen\\n            ? \'bg-teal-700 text-white\'\\n            : \'bg-slate-100 hover:bg-teal-50 text-slate-500 hover:text-teal-800 border border-slate-200\'\\n        }`}\\n      >\\n        <HelpCircle className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n      </button>\\n\\n      {isOpen && (\\n        <div\\n          role=\\\"tooltip\\\"\\n          className={`absolute top-full mt-2 z-30 w-64 sm:w-72 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white shadow-xl border border-slate-700 text-left space-y-1 ro-fade-in ${\\n            align === \'right\' ? \'right-0\' : \'left-0\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-teal-300\\\">{title}</span>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setIsOpen(false)}\\n              className=\\\"text-slate-400 hover:text-white cursor-pointer p-0.5\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"Tutup tooltip\\\"\\n            >\\n              <X className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-200 leading-relaxed\\\">{content}</p>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create BerandaWalkthrough and FeatureTooltip components to guide new users on the Beranda page\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/BerandaWalkthrough.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating walkthrough component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create BerandaWalkthrough.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\254$\n\251$\001i\024}\023\317\2734|\336q\230\274oK\017B\356PdVk\025\v\240\027-L\200RM\227\025\261\2740\255\367*FV\330\267\250\2419\220E!<\213\025\036-*\253%g\345\325iZ\307#\224\345\037-\006\270\317{\305[\025Q\235\256^\2460\003k\336H\220A\375\0361\323\035\340\252\372\332$F\273}\237\225^\267\3458\232\002*)\377\351\321z\302\334a\302\022\360q+\001\355\262\335\371\375D\236\v\216\264]\336\326\333$\317+Z5\347rB\315\253\302:\362\250H\244|\251/\315\241M\363\351\"\355\313\362\v\305Z;\004\333\202f\327h\310+\313f\036\353\270\322F\312?\223\305\266Y0\371\004\376e\233\355\325\230\342\346\3456\275\226+\037S\025%b\255.\330\3224\360\313\244D\364\372b\023\213\212\016\f\236\204~\304J\341k)b\320Y\005\366|^\"\245\317\\\241]i\261\312\275\265\234\216\307\345\002Z\214\253QZ%Es>\317I\212\377\225C\330!\263t%\336\364j\364\230\363[\242\020\304\035VM\222q8@\214\312S\322\224\322\004v\215\033A\335K\244\032\316Z\237I\245W\275B\030\333\332<\t:9r\'d+\307- C\205wF\372\367OD\006;\316\267c&\241D\344\205}k\232\200q\350\335\207U;\376\362\210\353yU\376\016\345O\242\306\352\365\205\243&tW\317\257\f\303\365,~\254vl\343T\2066\303#\210\027\344\356\241K\352\220\236m\024\020\261fr\252: \371\326\312\350\225\032y\305j\2714\377\341\377\257\336\r\317\211{Z\201\372+2\020a\206k\225\262&\341\244\201\336\005e\251W\f\256\3763\363]_\215\345\032\375\006\203\027\205\372\270n\243\267p\t\366\261\225l\022\033\215#\025\226\n\243\230QL\276\226\343\234\314d\026\0214;\267\260\362)\216\331\016\353\241\210y\371\211\220\202\375\202\fgd\331\265\302\375\256\"P/2\v\0218\020\243\270S\177\365\207_\367eW\ff?\277\250\313O\037\251p;\236+\201\266\024\373\004\214w\240D+ \243\017\237\350\232\252L\276!\212\312\335;*U\262w\244\304,\351\245\366\321\fM\261\n,\210\bv\270\204\003\002\2133\267C|.9.\236+\251\201\247\265\204\036\320\271\301\302\267t*\3535\232D\363*j{M\310\237E [\235\240\315\213/\216\335j\306u\336\237X\241\310-\206\333\335~L\215;\342\274\222v\fN\355S\343b)\314`\035\006zL\364\332\370\025\021\360\f<\005F\274