    thinking: "**Reviewing Metadata Instructions**\n\nI\'m carefully reviewing the metadata instructions. It seems I need to clarify any ambiguities with the user using the `ask_question` tool if more context is required. I must then wait for the user\'s responses before proceeding. This is critical for ensuring I remain on track, and for keeping the user informed of my activity.\n\n\n"
