  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Clarification Strategy**\n\nI\'m now focused on the initial clarification phase. My plan involves asking a series of focused, multiple-choice questions in the first turn, following the guidelines from the planning documentation. I\'ll stick to plain text and aim for concise options, with the goal of gathering critical information before proceeding with any implementation steps. I have begun drafting the initial questions.\n\n\n**Formulating Initial Questions**\n\nI\'ve crafted four impactful, Indonesian-language multiple-choice questions for the user to refine the Ruang Obat design. These cover aesthetic direction, the scope of redesign, visual enhancements, and layout. I\'m prioritizing clarity and relevance, aligning with the initial clarification phase. My goal is to elicit concrete preferences to guide subsequent steps effectively, and this will be delivered in the first turn.\n\n\n"
