  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Visual Aesthetic**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on defining the visual aesthetic. I have a good grasp of the target: a warm, calm medical editorial look across all pages and core components. This clear vision is helpful for further development.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Elements**\n\nI\'m currently refining key visual elements. I\'m focusing on a more spacious layout, fresh typography, and bespoke visual illustrations for the homepage. I\'m also refining animations for smoother transitions and card interactions. Updates to the display of stock graphs and drug packaging are also in progress. Importantly, full responsiveness across desktop and mobile is a top priority.\n\n\n"
