  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Application**: **Ruang Obat** (\"Kenali label obatmu, kelola obat di rumahmu\") \342\200\224 a clinical & community pharmacy education web app (S1 Farmasi thesis prototype) with strict ethical safeguards (general education only, no dose calculator, no personal medical diagnosis, official BPOM/Kemenkes/Farmakope citations, 100% local `localStorage` medicine inventory, mandatory footer disclaimer).\n- **Previous Turns (Completed)**:\n  1. Implemented Stage 2 Latihan modules (`SkenarioModule`, `FlashcardModule`, `KuisModule`, `LatihanView`) and updated thesis docs/PDF generator.\n  2. Added Recharts stock summary visualization (`RingkasanStokObatChart`) on `BerandaView`.\n  3. Added onboarding Walkthrough and contextual Tooltips (`BerandaWalkthrough`, `FeatureTooltip`) on `BerandaView`.\n  4. Enhanced real-time search, highlighting, clear button, and filter sync in `LemariView`.\n  5. Built full-stack server-side Gemini multi-turn SSE chatbot (`server.ts`, `server/knowledgeBase.ts`, `src/components/ChatbotWidget.tsx`) indexing website content and `.zip`/`.pdf`/`.txt`/`.md` books (`knowledge_books/` + UI upload).\n- **Current Task (Active \342\200\224 Planning Mode Phase 2)**:\n  - User request: *\"aku ingin memperbarui desainnya menjadi lebih menarik\"* with `[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]` requiring clarifying questions via `ask_question` first, waiting for answers, then presenting an implementation plan (`implementation_plan.md`) for approval before modifying any code.\n  - **Resolved User Preferences (from `ask_question` in Turn 1)**:\n    1. **Visual Aesthetic**: Editorial medis hangat dan tenang (*Warm & calm medical editorial*).\n    2. **Redesign Scope**: Seluruh halaman dan komponen utama (*All pages & core components*).\n    3. **Visual Enhancements (multi-select, all 4 chosen)**:\n       - Tata letak lebih lapang dan tipografi baru (*Spacious layout & new typography*).\n       - Ilustrasi visual khusus pada Beranda (*Custom visual illustration(s) on Beranda*).\n       - Animasi transisi dan interaksi kartu lebih halus (*Smoother transitions & card micro-interactions*).\n       - Pembaruan tampilan grafik stok dan kemasan obat (*Upgraded stock chart & interactive packaging SVGs*).\n    4. **Layout Structure**: Responsif penuh untuk desktop dan mobile (*Full responsive desktop + mobile layout*).\n\n## 2. Progress\n- **Completed in Earlier Turns**:\n  - `server.ts`, `server/knowledgeBase.ts`, `knowledge_books/README.txt`, `src/components/ChatbotWidget.tsx`, `src/components/RingkasanStokObatChart.tsx`, `src/components/BerandaWalkthrough.tsx`, `src/views/LatihanView.tsx`, `src/components/latihan/{SkenarioModule,FlashcardModule,KuisModule}.tsx`, `src/views/LemariView.tsx`, `src/views/BerandaView.tsx`, `src/App.tsx`, `package.json`, `DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.md`, `public/DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.txt`, `public/Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf`.\n  - Earlier server health check (`curl -s http://localhost:3000/api/health`) succeeded (`{\"ok\":true,\"summary\":{\"websiteChunks\":67,...}}`).\n- **Completed in Current Redesign Task**:\n  - Phase 1 (Clarification): Executed `ask_question` with 4 questions and received all 4 user answers.\n  - Phase 2 (Research \342\200\224 In Progress, NO code edits made):\n    - Read `/skills/system_skills/planning_mode/SKILL.md`.\n    - Read `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`.\n    - Read domain references required by Two-Hop Routing:\n      - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/6_education_simulations.md`\n      - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/10_mobile_touch_apps.md`\n    - Inspected `/src/views/CekLabelView.tsx`, `/src/components/PackagingSvg.tsx`, `/src/components/ui/index.ts` (plus previously inspected `index.html`, `src/index.css`, `src/App.tsx`, `src/components/Header.tsx`, `src/components/BottomNav.tsx`, `src/views/BerandaView.tsx`, `src/views/LemariView.tsx`, `src/views/PustakaView.tsx`, `src/components/TinjauDosenModal.tsx`).\n- **Remaining in Phase 2**:\n  - Briefly inspect remaining UI files if needed for complete plan accuracy (`src/components/FooterDisclaimer.tsx`, `src/components/ui/*`, `src/components/KamusModal.tsx`, `src/components/PanduanSimpanBuangModal.tsx`, `src/components/TentangModal.tsx`) \342\200\224 NO source edits allowed yet!\n  - Create `/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/1a2b9357-48f1-4f6d-870d-eefdd828204f/implementation_plan.md` using `write_to_file` with `ArtifactMetadata: { UserFacing: true, RequestFeedback: true, Summary: \"...\" }`, then STOP and wait for user approval (`Plan action: proceed` or revision feedback).\n- **Remaining in Phase 3 (Only AFTER user approves plan)**:\n  - Batch-generate custom Beranda illustrations via `generate_image` (Phase 1 image turn before referencing returned paths in Phase 2 component edit turn).\n  - Execute the approved full redesign across CSS tokens/typography, layout/navigation, Beranda, Cek Label (including PackagingSvg & 2-zone split), Lemari Obat, Latihan, Pustaka, modals, and ChatbotWidget, then verify with `compile_applet` + `lint_applet` + `restart_dev_server`.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Existing CSS Tokens Partially Unused**: `src/index.css` already defines warm-sage editorial CSS variables (`--bg: #F7F6F2`, `--surface: #FFFFFF`, `--surface-muted: #EFEEE8`, `--ink: #253530`, `--ink-muted: #55665F`, `--primary: #64877D`, `--brand: #4A6D62`, `--secondary: #DCEAE6`, `--forest: #263F3A`, `--sand: #D8B99A`) and Tailwind `@theme inline` tokens (`bg-bg`, `text-ink`, `bg-brand`, `bg-forest`, etc.), yet `App.tsx` and views still hardcode `bg-slate-50`, `bg-teal-700`, `text-slate-900`, etc. Unifying everything onto semantic theme tokens will instantly establish the requested warm, calm medical editorial look while keeping contrast crisp.\n- **Anti-Slop & Domain Design Gaps to Fix in the Plan**:\n  - Current `App.tsx` caps width at `max-w-4xl`; expanding to `max-w-6xl` / `max-w-7xl` on desktop (`lg:` 2-column grids, 2-zone split in `CekLabelView` per `6_education_simulations.md`: left visual stage ~55\342\200\22360%, right interactive detail deck ~40\342\200\22345%) avoids the cramped mobile-column-in-void feel while keeping `375px\342\200\223430px` touch ergonomics (`>= 44px` hitboxes, sticky height `<= 15%` viewport).\n  - `Header.tsx`: Currently has 2 action buttons (`Tinjau / Bagikan` + `Tentang`) in Zone 3 and a pill-styled icon badge. `frontend-design` Top Bar Contract requires 3 zones separated by `gap-8`: single-element wordmark in Zone 1, 4\342\200\2235 single-line (`whitespace-nowrap shrink-0`) nav links in Zone 2, and **1 primary CTA** in Zone 3 (`Tinjau` or moving `Tentang` cleanly into Footer/About link or keeping single primary CTA).\n  - Static metadata pills (`Media Edukasi Farmasi Klinis & Komunitas`, `Tahap 2 Aktif`, `{medicines.length} Obat`, `10 Butir Soal`, etc.) should be refactored to quiet unboxed typographic metadata with `\302\267` separators per Zero-Pill Discipline, reserving rounded button/segment styling strictly for interactive filters/tabs.\n  - Remove thick left accent borders (`border-l-4` in `SkenarioModule.tsx`) and decorative dots (`w-2 h-2 rounded-full` in `BerandaView` Skenario card; `animate-ping` dot in `PackagingSvg.tsx` \342\200\224 replace with crisp ring/scale focus highlight).\n  - Typography: Upgrade to an editorial medical serif + geometric sans pairing (`Fraunces` for expressive display headings + `DM Sans` or `Plus Jakarta Sans` for crisp readable body + `DM Mono` with `tabular-nums` strictly for codes/NIE/batch/metrics/scores).\n  - Custom Illustrations: Use `generate_image` (in a single parallel batch during Phase 3) for 1\342\200\2232 warm editorial medical illustrations on `BerandaView` (e.g., Hero botanical/apothecary medicine-cabinet editorial scene + quick-care/DAGUSIBU visual accent), with `referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\"`, descriptive `alt`, and styled CSS fallback containers.\n- **Technical Runtime Constraints Preserved**:\n  - `server.ts` runs Express + Vite middleware on port `3000` (`\"dev\": \"tsx server.ts\"`, `\"start\": \"node server.ts\"`).\n  - Node `v22.23.2` runs `node server.ts` natively with erasable TypeScript + `.ts` extensions (`server/knowledgeBase.ts`). Do NOT import `.jpg` image assets in `server.ts` or any file imported by `server.ts`.\n  - Gemini SDK `@google/genai@^3.3.0` is strictly server-side in `server.ts` with `\'User-Agent\': \'aistudio-build\'`, using `gemini-4-hydrogen` (`ThinkingLevel.MEDIUM`) and `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` (`ThinkingLevel.MINIMAL`).\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- **Error 1 (Resolved earlier)**: `tsc --noEmit` reported `TS2345` in `src/components/RingkasanStokObatChart.tsx` lines 215 & 285 (`entry.key` typed as `Key | null | undefined` in Recharts `onClick`). Fixed by updating `handleCategoryClick(categoryKey?: string)` and typing `onClick={(entry: any) => handleCategoryClick(entry?.key || entry?.payload?.key)}`, plus removing unused `activeIndex` state.\n- **Error 2 (Resolved earlier)**: `tsc --noEmit` reported `TS18004: No value exists in scope for the shorthand property \'activeTab\'` in `src/components/ChatbotWidget.tsx` line 277. Fixed to `activeTab: currentTab`.\n- **Note on `curl` check right after `restart_dev_server`**: Initial `curl` within 1s exited with code 7 while server was booting; succeeded 3s later.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- **Artifact Target Path**: `/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/1a2b9357-48f1-4f6d-870d-eefdd828204f/implementation_plan.md`\n- **Development URLs**:\n  - Dev: `https://ais-dev-i6cmepgnonm4mfj7yg2xyk-74888050060.asia-east1.run.app`\n  - Shared: `https://ais-pre-i6cmepgnonm4mfj7yg2xyk-74888050060.asia-east1.run.app`\n- **Knowledge Base State**: `knowledge_books/` folder initialized with `README.txt`; 67 website chunks indexed at startup; `.zip`/`.pdf`/`.txt`/`.md` uploads persisted in `knowledge_books/uploads/`.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. **Finish Light Inspection (Read-Only)**: If needed for plan completeness, inspect `src/components/ui/*`, `src/components/FooterDisclaimer.tsx`, `src/components/KamusModal.tsx`, `src/components/PanduanSimpanBuangModal.tsx`, and `src/components/TentangModal.tsx` via `view_file` (do NOT edit any source file yet!).\n2. **Write `implementation_plan.md` (Phase 2 Deliverable)**:\n   - Create `/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/1a2b9357-48f1-4f6d-870d-eefdd828204f/implementation_plan.md` using `write_to_file` with `ArtifactMetadata: { UserFacing: true, RequestFeedback: true, Summary: \"...\" }`.\n   - Follow `planning-mode/SKILL.md` template & rules strictly:\n     - Sections: `# Pembaruan Desain Editorial Medis Ruang Obat` + summary, `### User Review & Critical Decisions` (summarizing the 4 confirmed `ask_question` choices), `### 1. Overview & Core Concept`, `### 2. User Experience & Visual Design` (incorporating `Fraunces` + `DM Sans`/`Plus Jakarta Sans` + `DM Mono`, warm alabaster `#F7F6F2` + deep apothecary forest `#263F3A` + sage `#4A6D62` + warm sand `#D8B99A` 60-30-10 system, 2-zone Cek Label split, spacious `max-w-6xl` responsive layout, custom `generate_image` illustrations on Beranda, refined Recharts chart & crisp PackagingSvg illustrations, compositor-only `<=200ms` transitions, Zero-Pill & Top Bar 3-zone rules), `### 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs`, `### 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy` (with Unicode box-drawing ASCII diagram `\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\220`, `\342\224\202`, `\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\230`).\n     - **CRITICAL**: Do NOT include file paths, source file lists, or folder trees inside `implementation_plan.md`. Do NOT output the plan markdown in chat\342\200\224reply with only 1 brief sentence informing the user the plan is ready for review, then STOP and await approval.\n3. **Upon User Approval (`Plan action: proceed`) \342\200\224 Phase 3 Execution**:\n   - First turn after approval: Call `generate_image` in ONE parallel batch for the planned Beranda illustration(s) (e.g., `hero_ruang_obat_editorial` `4:3` or `16:9`, and optional supporting visual `dagusibu_editorial_shelf` `4:3`), without writing component files in that same turn.\n   - Subsequent turns: Implement the unified editorial design across `index.html`, `src/index.css`, `src/components/ui/*`, `Header.tsx`, `BottomNav.tsx`, `FooterDisclaimer.tsx`, `BerandaView.tsx`, `BerandaWalkthrough.tsx`, `RingkasanStokObatChart.tsx`, `CekLabelView.tsx`, `PackagingSvg.tsx`, `LemariView.tsx`, `LatihanView.tsx` + `components/latihan/*`, `PustakaView.tsx`, modals, and `ChatbotWidget.tsx`\342\200\224synthesizing all prior functional features (Recharts, Walkthrough/Tooltips, Lemari search, Gemini multi-turn `.zip` chatbot, PDF export, thesis ethical rules).\n   - Finally, co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`, then `restart_dev_server`.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Planning Mode Enforcement**: ZERO source file modifications, package installs, or state-changing commands until `implementation_plan.md` is approved by the user. Never print the plan contents in chat.\n- **Frontend Design Enforcement**: Zero static metadata pills, no `border-l-4` accents, no decorative pulsing/colored dots, no `//` pseudo-code prefixes, 3-zone header contract, `text-wrap: balance` on headlines, `tabular-nums` on numbers, `44px` minimum mobile touch targets, `<=15%` mobile sticky surface height, semantic dual-coded statuses (icon + text, never hue alone).\n- **Thesis Ethical Safeguards (Strict)**: Keep mandatory disclaimer, no dose calculator, no diagnosis, no fake claims/testimonials, preserve `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` citations & `localStorage` privacy.\n- **Language**: All UI copy and user communication in natural Indonesian.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_end: 221
    render_latest_checkpoint: true
    total_subagent_count: 0
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "Here is the full initial file tree for the application:\n/.env.example\n/.gitignore\n/DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.md\n/bun.lock\n/index.html\n/metadata.json\n/package.json\n/public/DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.txt\n/public/Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf\n/scripts/generate_pdf.mjs\n/src/App.tsx\n/src/components/BottomNav.tsx\n/src/components/FooterDisclaimer.tsx\n/src/components/Header.tsx\n/src/components/KamusModal.tsx\n/src/components/PackagingSvg.tsx\n/src/components/PanduanSimpanBuangModal.tsx\n/src/components/TentangModal.tsx\n/src/components/TinjauDosenModal.tsx\n/src/components/ui/Button.tsx\n/src/components/ui/Card.tsx\n/src/components/ui/Chip.tsx\n/src/components/ui/ConfirmDialog.tsx\n/src/components/ui/EmptyState.tsx\n/src/components/ui/ModalShell.tsx\n/src/components/ui/RujukanText.tsx\n/src/components/ui/SegmentedControl.tsx\n/src/components/ui/StatusBadge.tsx\n/src/components/ui/index.ts\n/src/data/initialMedicines.ts\n/src/data/kamusData.ts\n/src/data/labelHotspots.ts\n/src/data/panduanSimpanBuang.ts\n/src/data/pustakaData.ts\n/src/index.css\n/src/main.tsx\n/src/types/index.ts\n/src/utils/generatePdfClient.ts\n/src/utils/medicineUtils.ts\n/src/views/BerandaView.tsx\n/src/views/CekLabelView.tsx\n/src/views/LatihanPreviewView.tsx\n/src/views/LemariView.tsx\n/src/views/PustakaView.tsx\n/tsconfig.json\n/vite.config.ts\n\nThe following dependencies are installed:\n@google/genai: ^2.4.0\n@tailwindcss/vite: ^4.3.3\n@vitejs/plugin-react: ^6.1.1\ndotenv: ^17.2.3\nexpress: ^4.21.2\njspdf: ^4.2.1\nlucide-react: ^0.546.0\nmotion: ^12.23.24\nreact: ^19.0.1\nreact-dom: ^19.0.1\nvite: ^8.3.0\n\nThe following devDependencies are installed:\n@types/express: ^4.17.21\n@types/node: ^22.14.0\n@types/react: ^19.3.0\n@types/react-dom: ^19.3.0\nautoprefixer: ^10.4.21\nesbuild: ^0.25.0\ntailwindcss: ^4.3.3\ntsx: ^4.21.0\ntypescript: ^7.0.2\n\nKey file contents:\n\n--- /.env.example ---\n```\n# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI API calls.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.\n# Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.\nGEMINI_API_KEY=\"MY_GEMINI_API_KEY\"\n\n# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.\n# Used for self-referential links, OAuth callbacks, and API endpoints.\nAPP_URL=\"MY_APP_URL\"\n\n```\n\n--- /index.html ---\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover\" />\n    <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#F7F6F2\" />\n    <title>Ruang Obat \342\200\223 Kenali Label Obatmu, Kelola Obat di Rumahmu</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Media edukasi farmasi klinis dan komunitas untuk mengenali informasi label obat dan mengelola obat rumah tangga secara bijak dan aman.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Ruang Obat \342\200\223 Kenali Label Obatmu, Kelola Obat di Rumahmu\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Media edukasi farmasi klinis dan komunitas untuk mengenali informasi label obat dan mengelola obat rumah tangga secara bijak dan aman.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,400..700;1,9..40,400..700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:ital,wght@0,400..800;1,400..800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  </head>\n  <body class=\"antialiased\">\n    <div id=\"root\"></div>\n    <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.tsx\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n\n\n```\n\n--- /metadata.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Remix Ruang Obat\",\n  \"description\": \"Kenali label obatmu, kelola obat di rumahmu. Media edukasi farmasi klinis dan komunitas.\",\n  \"requestFramePermissions\": [],\n  \"majorCapabilities\": [\n    \"MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n--- /src/App.tsx ---\n```typescript\nimport { useState, useEffect } from \'react\';\nimport { TabType, MedicineItem } from \'./types\';\nimport { getInitialMedicines } from \'./data/initialMedicines\';\nimport { calculateDaysRemaining } from \'./utils/medicineUtils\';\nimport { Header } from \'./components/Header\';\nimport { BottomNav } from \'./components/BottomNav\';\nimport { FooterDisclaimer } from \'./components/FooterDisclaimer\';\nimport { TentangModal } from \'./components/TentangModal\';\nimport { KamusModal } from \'./components/KamusModal\';\nimport { PanduanSimpanBuangModal } from \'./components/PanduanSimpanBuangModal\';\nimport { TinjauDosenModal } from \'./components/TinjauDosenModal\';\nimport { BerandaView } from \'./views/BerandaView\';\nimport { CekLabelView } from \'./views/CekLabelView\';\nimport { LemariView } from \'./views/LemariView\';\nimport { LatihanPreviewView } from \'./views/LatihanPreviewView\';\nimport { PustakaView } from \'./views/PustakaView\';\n\nconst STORAGE_KEY = \'ruang_obat_medicines_v1\';\n\nexport default function App() {\n  const [currentTab, setCurrentTab] = useState<TabType>(\'beranda\');\n  const [lemariFilter, setLemariFilter] = useState<\'semua\' | \'aman\' | \'segera\' | \'kedaluwarsa\'>(\'semua\');\n  \n  // Modals state\n  const [isAboutOpen, setIsAboutOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [isKamusOpen, setIsKamusOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [isTinjauOpen, setIsTinjauOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [panduanState, setPanduanState] = useState<{ isOpen: boolean; mode: \'simpan\' | \'buang\' }>({\n    isOpen: false,\n    mode: \'simpan\'\n  });\n\n  // LocalStorage state for medicines\n  const [medicines, setMedicines] = useState<MedicineItem[]>(() => {\n    try {\n      const stored = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);\n      if (stored) {\n        return JSON.parse(stored);\n      }\n    } catch {\n      // ignore\n    }\n    return getInitialMedicines();\n  });\n\n  // Save to localStorage whenever medicines change\n  useEffect(() => {\n    try {\n      localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify(medicines));\n    } catch {\n      // storage unavailable or full\n    }\n  }, [medicines]);\n\n  // Handle adding new medicine\n  const handleAddMedicine = (newItem: Omit<MedicineItem, \'id\' | \'createdAt\'>) => {\n    const item: MedicineItem = {\n      ...newItem,\n      id: `med-${Date.now()}`,\n      createdAt: Date.now()\n    };\n    setMedicines((prev) => [item, ...prev]);\n  };\n\n  // Handle editing existing medicine\n  const handleEditMedicine = (id: string, updated: Omit<MedicineItem, \'id\' | \'createdAt\'>) => {\n    setMedicines((prev) =>\n      prev.map((item) => (item.id === id ? { ...item, ...updated } : item))\n    );\n  };\n\n  // Handle deleting medicine\n  const handleDeleteMedicine = (id: string) => {\n    setMedicines((prev) => prev.filter((item) => item.id !== id));\n  };\n\n  // Quick navigation to Lemari with warning filter\n  const handleNavigateLemariWithFilter = (filter: \'segera\' | \'kedaluwarsa\' | \'semua\') => {\n    setLemariFilter(filter);\n    setCurrentTab(\'lemari\');\n    window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'smooth\' });\n  };\n\n  // Count expiring medicines for bottom nav badge\n  const expiringCount = medicines.filter((m) => {\n    const days = calculateDaysRemaining(m.expiryDate);\n    return days <= 30;\n  }).length;\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-slate-50 text-slate-800\">\n      {/* Top Header */}\n      <Header\n        currentTab={currentTab}\n        onNavigate={(tab) => {\n          setCurrentTab(tab);\n          window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'smooth\' });\n        }}\n        onOpenAbout={() => setIsAboutOpen(true)}\n        onOpenTinjau={() => setIsTinjauOpen(true)}\n      />\n\n      {/* Main Content Area */}\n      <main className=\"flex-1 max-w-4xl w-full mx-auto px-4 py-4 sm:py-6 md:py-8\">\n        {currentTab === \'beranda\' && (\n          <BerandaView\n            onNavigate={(tab) => {\n              setCurrentTab(tab);\n              window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'smooth\' });\n            }}\n            onNavigateLemariWithFilter={handleNavigateLemariWithFilter}\n            medicines={medicines}\n            onOpenKamus={() => setIsKamusOpen(true)}\n            onOpenTinjau={() => setIsTinjauOpen(true)}\n          />\n        )}\n\n        {currentTab === \'cek-label\' && (\n          <CekLabelView onOpenKamus={() => setIsKamusOpen(true)} />\n        )}\n\n        {currentTab === \'lemari\' && (\n          <LemariView\n            medicines={medicines}\n            onAddMedicine={handleAddMedicine}\n            onEditMedicine={handleEditMedicine}\n            onDeleteMedicine={handleDeleteMedicine}\n            initialFilter={lemariFilter}\n            onOpenPanduan={(mode = \'simpan\') =>\n              setPanduanState({ isOpen: true, mode })\n            }\n          />\n        )}\n\n        {currentTab === \'latihan\' && (\n          <LatihanPreviewView\n            onNavigate={(tab) => {\n              setCurrentTab(tab);\n              window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'smooth\' });\n            }}\n          />\n        )}\n\n        {currentTab === \'pustaka\' && <PustakaView />}\n      </main>\n\n      {/* Footer Disclaimer */}\n      <FooterDisclaimer />\n\n      {/* Mobile Bottom Navigation (5 Tabs) */}\n      <BottomNav\n        currentTab={currentTab}\n        onNavigate={(tab) => {\n          setCurrentTab(tab);\n          window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'smooth\' });\n        }}\n        expiringCount={expiringCount}\n      />\n\n      {/* Modals */}\n      <TentangModal\n        isOpen={isAboutOpen}\n        onClose={() => setIsAboutOpen(false)}\n      />\n\n      <KamusModal\n        isOpen={isKamusOpen}\n        onClose={() => setIsKamusOpen(false)}\n      />\n\n      <PanduanSimpanBuangModal\n        isOpen={panduanState.isOpen}\n        initialTab={panduanState.mode}\n        onClose={() => setPanduanState({ isOpen: false, mode: \'simpan\' })}\n      />\n\n      <TinjauDosenModal\n        isOpen={isTinjauOpen}\n        onClose={() => setIsTinjauOpen(false)}\n      />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/index.css ---\n```css\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n:root {\n  --bg: #F7F6F2;\n  --surface: #FFFFFF;\n  --surface-muted: #EFEEE8;\n  --elevated: #FFFFFF;\n  --line: #E3E6DF;\n  --line-strong: #64877D;\n  --ink: #253530;\n  --ink-muted: #55665F;\n  --primary: #64877D;\n  --brand: #4A6D62;\n  --on-brand: #FFFFFF;\n  --secondary: #DCEAE6;\n  --forest: #263F3A;\n  --sand: #D8B99A;\n  --focus: #4A6D62;\n\n  --status-aman-text: #2F6B4F;\n  --status-aman-bg: #E4F1EA;\n  --status-segera-text: #7A4B0C;\n  --status-segera-bg: #F8EBD3;\n  --status-kedaluwarsa-text: #8E2F2F;\n  --status-kedaluwarsa-bg: #F6E1DE;\n}\n\n@theme inline {\n  --color-bg: var(--bg);\n  --color-surface: var(--surface);\n  --color-surface-muted: var(--surface-muted);\n  --color-elevated: var(--elevated);\n  --color-line: var(--line);\n  --color-line-strong: var(--line-strong);\n  --color-ink: var(--ink);\n  --color-ink-muted: var(--ink-muted);\n  --color-primary: var(--primary);\n  --color-brand: var(--brand);\n  --color-on-brand: var(--on-brand);\n  --color-secondary: var(--secondary);\n  --color-forest: var(--forest);\n  --color-sand: var(--sand);\n  --color-focus: var(--focus);\n\n  --color-status-aman-text: var(--status-aman-text);\n  --color-status-aman-bg: var(--status-aman-bg);\n  --color-status-segera-text: var(--status-segera-text);\n  --color-status-segera-bg: var(--status-segera-bg);\n  --color-status-kedaluwarsa-text: var(--status-kedaluwarsa-text);\n  --color-status-kedaluwarsa-bg: var(--status-kedaluwarsa-bg);\n\n  --font-heading: \'Plus Jakarta Sans\', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  --font-body: \'DM Sans\', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  --font-mono: \'DM Mono\', monospace;\n}\n\n@layer base {\n  body {\n    font-family: var(--font-body);\n    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.05vw, 17px);\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background-color: var(--bg);\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;\n  }\n\n  h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {\n    font-family: var(--font-heading);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    text-wrap: balance;\n  }\n\n  *:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid var(--focus);\n    outline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Utilitas Animasi Sendiri (<= 200ms) */\n@keyframes roFadeIn {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(4px);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0);\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes roSheetIn {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(16px);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0);\n  }\n}\n\n.ro-fade-in {\n  animation: roFadeIn 180ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;\n}\n\n.ro-sheet-in {\n  animation: roSheetIn 200ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;\n}\n\n/* Safe area inset untuk bottom bar mobile */\n.pb-safe {\n  padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);\n}\n\n/* Aturan reduced-motion */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  *,\n  *::before,\n  *::after {\n    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n    scroll-behavior: auto !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Mode Print */\n@media print {\n  :root {\n    --bg: #FFFFFF !important;\n    --surface: #FFFFFF !important;\n    --ink: #000000 !important;\n    --line: #CCCCCC !important;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    background: #FFFFFF !important;\n    color: #000000 !important;\n  }\n\n  header,\n  nav[aria-label=\"Navigasi Utama\"],\n  .no-print {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/main.tsx ---\n```typescript\nimport {createRoot} from \'react-dom/client\';\nimport App from \'./App.tsx\';\nimport \'./index.css\';\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById(\'root\')!).render(<App />);\n\n```\n\n--- /tsconfig.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"experimentalDecorators\": true,\n    \"useDefineForClassFields\": false,\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"types\": [\"vite/client\"],\n    \"lib\": [\n      \"ES2022\",\n      \"DOM\",\n      \"DOM.Iterable\"\n    ],\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"moduleDetection\": \"force\",\n    \"allowJs\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\n        \"./*\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"allowImportingTsExtensions\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true\n  },\n  \"exclude\": [\"dist\"]\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /vite.config.ts ---\n```typescript\nimport tailwindcss from \'@tailwindcss/vite\';\nimport react from \'@vitejs/plugin-react\';\nimport path from \'path\';\nimport {defineConfig} from \'vite\';\n\nexport default defineConfig(() => {\n  return {\n    plugins: [react(), tailwindcss()],\n    resolve: {\n      alias: {\n        \'@\': path.resolve(__dirname, \'.\'),\n      },\n    },\n    server: {\n      // HMR is disabled in AI Studio via DISABLE_HMR env var.\n      // Do not modify\342\200\224file watching is disabled to prevent flickering during agent edits.\n      hmr: process.env.DISABLE_HMR !== \'true\',\n      // Disable file watching when DISABLE_HMR is true to save CPU during agent edits.\n      watch: process.env.DISABLE_HMR === \'true\' ? null : {},\n    },\n  };\n});\n\n```"
