  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Frontend Design**\n\nI\'ve just received the green light to proceed with the implementation plan. I\'m now meticulously reviewing the frontend design and image asset workflow before diving into Phase 3. Specifically, I plan to generate custom images in a single, parallel batch initially. The crucial point is to avoid writing any component code that references these images until I have their returned paths. I want to optimize image generation within this process.\n\n\n**Creating Illustrations Details**\n\nI\'m now focused on generating two specific editorial illustrations for `BerandaView`. The first, `hero_ruang_obat`, depicts a serene home apothecary corner. The second, `dagusibu_home_care`, illustrates safe home medication organization. These are to be flat-vector style illustrations, adhering to the specified color palette and minimalist aesthetic, with no text. I\'m keen on delivering these images promptly and seamlessly.\n\n\n"
