    thinking: "**Ensuring Strict Compliance**\n\nI\'m focused on executing Batch 4 and meticulously ensuring that every \"anti-slop\" and domain rule is strictly respected throughout the implementation of `LatihanView.tsx`, `SkenarioModule.tsx`, `FlashcardModule.tsx`, `KuisModule.tsx`, and `PustakaView.tsx`. This includes a careful review of each module.\n\n\n**Refining UI Elements**\n\nI\'m currently refining the UI elements for `LatihanView.tsx` by replacing static pills with dynamic eyebrow metadata and implementing a segmented sub-tab switcher for improved clarity. For `SkenarioModule.tsx`, I\'ve removed the accent border and styled the narrative as an editorial quote block, while adjusting the header ribbon and badges for a warmer aesthetic. I\'m also revising the interactive choice options to enhance usability.\n\n\n**Optimizing Component Design**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on optimizing the design of key components. For `FlashcardModule.tsx`, I\'m focusing on the visual hierarchy, with warm category filter tabs and a spacious 3D flip card, aiming for clarity in both the front and back faces. Also, I\'ve eliminated `animate-spin-slow` on the `RotateCw` icon, except in non-standard cases.\n\nI\'m removing any instances of `window.alert` in `KuisModule.tsx` in favor of inline notice toggles. I am also replacing the static pill with an eyebrow metadata for a cleaner look.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "L6UBa9qDBqSf_uMP9pfq-QQ"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_10249457130600066040"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { TabType } from \'../types\';\\nimport { LatihanSubTab } from \'../types/latihan\';\\nimport { SkenarioModule } from \'../components/latihan/SkenarioModule\';\\nimport { FlashcardModule } from \'../components/latihan/FlashcardModule\';\\nimport { KuisModule } from \'../components/latihan/KuisModule\';\\nimport { GitBranch, Layers, FileCheck2, ArrowLeft } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface LatihanViewProps {\\n  onNavigate: (tab: TabType) => void;\\n  initialSubTab?: LatihanSubTab;\\n}\\n\\nexport const LatihanView: React.FC<LatihanViewProps> = ({\\n  onNavigate,\\n  initialSubTab = \'skenario\',\\n}) => {\\n  const [activeSubTab, setActiveSubTab] = useState<LatihanSubTab>(initialSubTab);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"space-y-6 sm:space-y-8 pb-12 ro-fade-in\\\">\\n      {/* Top Breadcrumb & Editorial Header */}\\n      <div className=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          onClick={() => onNavigate(\'beranda\')}\\n          className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-brand hover:text-forest cursor-pointer mb-1 py-1\\\"\\n        >\\n          <ArrowLeft className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n          <span>Kembali ke Beranda</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <p className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-brand\\\">\\n          Instrumen Skripsi S1 Farmasi \302\267 Modul Latihan &amp; Evaluasi\\n        </p>\\n\\n        <h1 className=\\\"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-forest tracking-tight\\\">\\n          Latihan &amp; Uji Pemahaman\\n        </h1>\\n        <p className=\\\"text-ink-muted text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\\\">\\n          Asah ketepatan membaca label dan mengambil keputusan swamedikasi melalui skenario kasus nyata, flashcard interaktif, serta kuis evaluasi terstandar.\\n        </p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Sub-tab Navigation (Skenario, Flashcard, Kuis) */}\\n      <div\\n        className=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-1.5 p-1.5 bg-surface-muted rounded-2xl border border-line\\\"\\n        role=\\\"tablist\\\"\\n        aria-label=\\\"Pilih modul latihan\\\"\\n      >\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          role=\\\"tab\\\"\\n          aria-selected={activeSubTab === \'skenario\'}\\n          onClick={() => {\\n            setActiveSubTab(\'skenario\');\\n            window.scrollTo({ top: 120, behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n          }}\\n          className={`min-h-[46px] px-2 sm:px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n            activeSubTab === \'skenario\'\\n              ? \'bg-surface text-forest shadow-xs\'\\n              : \'text-ink-muted hover:text-forest\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          <GitBranch className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-brand shrink-0\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">Skenario Kasus</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          role=\\\"tab\\\"\\n          aria-selected={activeSubTab === \'flashcard\'}\\n          onClick={() => {\\n            setActiveSubTab(\'flashcard\');\\n            window.scrollTo({ top: 120, behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n          }}\\n          className={`min-h-[46px] px-2 sm:px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n            activeSubTab === \'flashcard\'\\n              ? \'bg-surface text-forest shadow-xs\'\\n              : \'text-ink-muted hover:text-forest\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          <Layers className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-brand shrink-0\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">Flashcard</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          role=\\\"tab\\\"\\n          aria-selected={activeSubTab === \'kuis\'}\\n          onClick={() => {\\n            setActiveSubTab(\'kuis\');\\n            window.scrollTo({ top: 120, behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n          }}\\n          className={`min-h-[46px] px-2 sm:px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n            activeSubTab === \'kuis\'\\n              ? \'bg-surface text-forest shadow-xs\'\\n              : \'text-ink-muted hover:text-forest\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          <FileCheck2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-brand shrink-0\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">Kuis Pre/Post</span>\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Active Tab Content */}\\n      <div className=\\\"pt-1\\\">\\n        {activeSubTab === \'skenario\' && <SkenarioModule />}\\n        {activeSubTab === \'flashcard\' && <FlashcardModule />}\\n        {activeSubTab === \'kuis\' && <KuisModule />}\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Redesign LatihanView with warm editorial typography, unboxed eyebrow metadata, and cohesive segmented controls\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/views/LatihanView.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Redesigning LatihanView layout\", \"toolSummary\":\"Redesign LatihanView.tsx\"}"
