  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 1
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Application**: **Ruang Obat** (\"Kenali label obatmu, kelola obat di rumahmu\") \342\200\224 clinical & community pharmacy education web app.\n- **Prior Task (Completed Earlier)**: Full warm medical editorial redesign across UI components (`index.html`, `src/index.css`, `src/App.tsx`, `Header`, `BottomNav`, `FooterDisclaimer`, `BerandaView`, `CekLabelView`, `PackagingSvg`, `LemariView`, `LatihanView`, `PustakaView`, modals, `ChatbotWidget`) \342\200\224 compiled, linted (`tsc --noEmit` clean), and dev server restarted.\n- **Current Task (PART 3 \342\200\224 Active, Pre-Approval Step)**:\n  Apply **PART 3** changes covering official project identity, hiding reviewer/lecturer-only tools behind a config flag, terminology standardization, moving `public/` prototype docs out of `public/`, updating PDF & reviewer modal copy (removing \"Claude\" & \"prototipe\"), calming `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` placeholder rendering in UI, and specific Tailwind token/font/color refinements.\n  - **CRITICAL WORKFLOW GATE**: First output **RINGKASAN RENCANA perubahan per file** (file list + change type) in Indonesian, then **STOP and wait for `\"SETUJU\"`** BEFORE modifying any code or moving files.\n  - **Single-Source Identity Data (`src/data/identitasProyek.ts`)**:\n    - Institusi: `Institut Kesehatan Widya Dharma Husada Tangerang`\n    - Program studi: `S1 Farmasi Klinik dan Komunitas` (**NOT** \"Klinis\")\n    - Kategori proyek: `Departemen Ilmu Farmasi Klinis \342\200\224 Website Berbasis Sistem Informasi / Media Edukasi Digital`\n    - Jenis karya: `Tugas Akhir Berbasis Proyek` (**NOT** \"skripsi\")\n    - Tahun: `2026`\n    - Tim pengembang:\n      1. `Andika Bella Pratama Putra` (`NIM 231030790839`)\n      2. `Nur Abdullah Kholiq` (`NIM 231030790829`)\n      3. `Syahrul Ramdhani` (`NIM 231030791114`)\n    - Kalimat batasan: `\"Ruang Obat adalah media edukasi informasi obat dan tidak menggantikan saran apoteker atau dokter. Jangan mengobati diri sendiri tanpa bertanya kepada apoteker atau dokter.\"`\n    - Status versi: `\"Versi pengembangan 2026\"`\n\n## 2. Progress\n- **Completed (Earlier Part 1 Redesign)**:\n  - Warm editorial UI implemented, `compile_applet` + `lint_applet` passed, dev server running at `https://ais-dev-i6cmepgnonm4mfj7yg2xyk-74888050060.asia-east1.run.app`.\n- **Completed in PART 3 (Read-Only Research Only \342\200\224 ZERO files created/edited/moved yet)**:\n  - Inspected `/src/utils/generatePdfClient.ts`, `/src/components/ui/RujukanText.tsx`, `/DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.md`, `/metadata.json`, `/public/` (`DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.txt`, `Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf`).\n  - Ran broad `grep` across `src index.html metadata.json DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.md scripts public`, but output was truncated at the start (`<truncated 24 bytes>` and earlier `src/` lines were cut off before `src/data/labelHotspots.ts:239`).\n- **Remaining in PART 3**:\n  1. Run a non-truncated targeted `grep` inside `src/` (excluding `labelHotspots.ts` data placeholder noise or inspecting `src/components`, `src/views`, `src/data` separately) so EVERY affected file and `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN` render site + `\"Claude\"`/`\"Klinis\"`/`\"skripsi\"`/`\"prototipe\"` match is known with 100% precision before writing the plan.\n  2. Output **RINGKASAN RENCANA** per file to the user in formal Indonesian and **STOP**, waiting for `\"SETUJU\"`.\n  3. Only AFTER `\"SETUJU\"`: execute all 7 workstreams, test all verification criteria (`375px` layout, `>=44px` hitboxes, `>=16px` body font, `SHOW_REVIEWER_TOOLS` false & true behavior, `/Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf` 404/unavailable, zero leftover placeholders/terms in UI, report remaining `\"Claude\"` occurrences in source code), run `compile_applet` + `lint_applet` + `restart_dev_server`.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **`public/` Static Files**: Contains `DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.txt` and `Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf`. Both must be moved outside `public/` (e.g., to `docs/arsip/`), NOT deleted. Also check `TinjauDosenModal.tsx` (`pdfUrl` was actually removed in the redesign or needs checking\342\200\224currently `TinjauDosenModal.tsx` uses client-side `generateAndDownloadPdf()` without a `pdfUrl` link, though `scripts/generate_pdf.mjs` writes `public/Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf`\342\200\224need to report/update any references found).\n- **`src/components/ui/RujukanText.tsx`**: Currently renders `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN...]` raw text inside a dashed mono box! Part 3 requirement #6 states: keep `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` unchanged in data files, and in rendering components when text starts with `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN`, show calm neutral message `\"Materi sedang dalam proses validasi pakar.\"` Also check `CekLabelView.tsx` and other views/modals (`CekLabelView.tsx` currently renders `{activeHotspot.content.meaning/tips/warning}` directly as `<p>` instead of `<RujukanText>`, which causes `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` to leak straight to screen! Same check needed for `KamusModal`, `PanduanSimpanBuangModal`, `Latihan`, etc.).\n- **Typography & Color Tokens (`src/index.css` & `index.html`)**:\n  - Earlier redesign added `Fraunces` (`font-display`) and `DM Sans` body font. Part 3 requirement #7 specifies: **Plus Jakarta Sans** for heading & body (single family) + system fallback, body `>= 16px` (`clamp(16px, ...)`), `text-brand`/`text-forest`/`text-ink` for text (NEVER `text-primary` on text because `--primary` `#64877D` has ~4:1 contrast vs white, below WCAG AA 4.5:1; `text-primary`/`bg-primary` icons/borders/decorations only).\n  - Header & wide dark surfaces: `bg-forest`. Buttons & accents: `bg-brand` (update buttons that currently use `bg-forest` if needed per rule: *\"Header dan permukaan gelap luas: bg-forest. Tombol dan aksen: bg-brand.\"*). Ensure `on-brand` token exists (it does: `--on-brand: #FFFFFF` / `--color-on-brand`). Keep indigo, amber, and emerald (flashcard & medicine statuses) untouched if used or ensure status colors remain compliant.\n- **`Header.tsx` & `SHOW_REVIEWER_TOOLS`**:\n  - Currently `Header.tsx` Zone 3 has 1 button (`Tinjau / Bagikan`) calling `onOpenTinjau`. When `SHOW_REVIEWER_TOOLS = false`, reviewer access (`TinjauDosenModal` + Beranda reviewer PDF card) must be hidden, while preserving/exposing a public share-link action if appropriate (check whether `Header.tsx` should show a lightweight public \"Bagikan\" copy-link/share popover when `SHOW_REVIEWER_TOOLS = false` and hide reviewer/dosen parts).\n- **Files NOT to Touch (Strict Forbidden List)**:\n  - Chatbot logic (`src/components/ChatbotWidget.tsx` logic, `server.ts`, `server/knowledgeBase.ts`, `knowledge_books/` folder contents, Gemini model names, secrets/API keys). Wait: check if `ChatbotWidget.tsx` has any `\"Klinis\"`/`\"skripsi\"`/`[ISI DARI RUJUKAN` display text or Tailwind styling \342\200\224 DO NOT alter chatbot logic/server/models, and if `ChatbotWidget.tsx` renders `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN...]` or \"skripsi\", verify carefully vs forbidden list! Note: rule says *\"JANGAN mengubah: logika chatbot, server.ts, server/knowledgeBase.ts, isi folder knowledge_books, nama model Gemini, dan secrets/API key\"*.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- Earlier `RingkasanStokObatChart.tsx` Recharts TypeScript typing issue was fixed cleanly before compaction (`tsc --noEmit` & Vite build passing).\n- Truncated `grep` output in the current turn means `src/` matches prior to `labelHotspots.ts:239` have NOT been read yet and MUST be inspected in the next turn before drafting the file-by-file plan.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- **Repository Root**: `/app/applet`\n- **Dev Server**: Running via `tsx server.ts` on port `3000`.\n- **Forbidden Areas**: `server.ts`, `server/knowledgeBase.ts`, `knowledge_books/**`, Gemini model names, chatbot streaming/RAG logic, API keys/secrets, and raw `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` strings inside `src/data/*`.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. **Complete Read-Only Inspection (NO edits yet!)**:\n   - Run targeted `grep` commands in `src/` excluding `labelHotspots.ts` (and separately `grep -rnE \"\\[ISI DARI RUJUKAN\" src/`) to find every occurrence of:\n     - `Klinis` / `Skripsi` / `skripsi` / `Claude` / `prototipe` / `Prototipe` / `[ISI`\n     - `text-primary` / `slate-` / `teal-` / `Fraunces` / `DM Sans` / `bg-forest` / `bg-brand`\n     - `RujukanText` usages across `src/`\n     - Any reference to `Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf` or `DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI`\n   - View any remaining uninspected files that match (e.g., `src/data/*.ts`, `src/views/LatihanPreviewView.tsx`, `src/components/ui/EmptyState.tsx`, `src/components/ui/Chip.tsx`, `scripts/generate_pdf.mjs`, `package.json`).\n2. **Write `RINGKASAN RENCANA` in Chat & WAIT for `\"SETUJU\"`**:\n   - List every file to create/modify/move and the exact type of change (covering Tasks 1\342\200\2237, including any edge cases like `Header.tsx` public share button vs reviewer-only modal trigger, `RujukanText` integration wherever `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN` is rendered, `LatihanPreviewView.tsx` or `ChatbotWidget.tsx` findings, etc.).\n   - Also report any out-of-scope findings rather than fixing them silently (*\"Temuan lain cukup dilaporkan, jangan diperbaiki\"*).\n   - **STOP** immediately after presenting the plan and wait for `\"SETUJU\"`.\n3. **Upon Receiving `\"SETUJU\"` \342\200\224 Execute PART 3**:\n   - Create `src/data/identitasProyek.ts` and `src/config/appConfig.ts` (`SHOW_REVIEWER_TOOLS = false`).\n   - Move `public/Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf` and `public/DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.txt` out of `public/` to `docs/arsip/` via `move` tool, and update `scripts/generate_pdf.mjs` / references if needed.\n   - Update `TentangModal.tsx`, `FooterDisclaimer.tsx`, `TinjauDosenModal.tsx`, `BerandaView.tsx`, `Header.tsx`, `App.tsx`, `generatePdfClient.ts`, `DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.md`, `index.html`, `metadata.json`, `src/index.css`, `RujukanText.tsx`, `CekLabelView.tsx` (and all components rendering `RujukanText` / `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN` or containing `Klinis`/`skripsi`/outdated palette tokens).\n   - Verify all items in `PENGUJIAN`, run `compile_applet` + `lint_applet` + `restart_dev_server`, verify HTTP status of `/Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf`, test/inspect `375px` responsiveness & `grep` remaining `\"Claude\"` occurrences (file + line numbers), and deliver a thorough verification report in formal Indonesian.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Mandatory Pre-Code Gate**: Output `RINGKASAN RENCANA` per file first and wait for explicit `\"SETUJU\"` before touching any file.\n- **Preservation Guarantees**: Do NOT modify `server.ts`, `server/knowledgeBase.ts`, `knowledge_books/**`, Gemini models, chatbot logic, or API keys/secrets; do NOT invent or overwrite `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` strings in `src/data/*`.\n- **Styling Rules**: Tailwind-first, no custom CSS outside `src/index.css` tokens, `Plus Jakarta Sans` for both heading and body + system fallback, `text-brand`/`text-forest`/`text-ink` for text (no `text-primary` on text), preserve indigo/amber/emerald colors on flashcards & status badges, `>= 44px` touch targets, `>= 16px` body text, verify `375px` width.\n- **Code Integrity & Language**: Write complete files (never truncated), formal Indonesian (`Bahasa Indonesia baku`), no unrequested features, report extra findings without altering them.\n</summary>"
