&amp; Batasan Etika</span>\n            </button>\n          )}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n};\n"
        path {
          absolute_uri: "file:///src/components/FooterDisclaimer.tsx"
        }
        overwrite: true
      }
    }
