  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 2
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Goal**: Execute **PART 3** modifications on **Ruang Obat** (clinical & community pharmacy education web app) after user approval (`\"Setuju\"` received in previous turn).\n- **Target URLs**:\n  - Dev URL: `https://ais-dev-i6cmepgnonm4mfj7yg2xyk-74888050060.asia-east1.run.app`\n  - Shared URL: `https://ais-pre-i6cmepgnonm4mfj7yg2xyk-74888050060.asia-east1.run.app`\n- **Core Requirements (Items 1\342\200\2237)**:\n  1. Single-source identity constants in `src/data/identitasProyek.ts` used in `TentangModal.tsx` (replacing 3 placeholders + adding `\"Tim Pengembang Website\"` block with paragraph, names + NIM, `programStudi \342\200\242 institusi (2026)`), `FooterDisclaimer.tsx` (NO NIMs in public footer), `TinjauDosenModal.tsx`, `generatePdfClient.ts`, and `DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.md`.\n  2. Terminology standardization: `\"Farmasi Klinis dan Komunitas\"` \342\206\222 `\"Farmasi Klinik dan Komunitas\"` (`\"Klinis\"` kept only on `\"Departemen Ilmu Farmasi Klinis\"`), `\"Skripsi\"` \342\206\222 `\"Tugas Akhir Berbasis Proyek\"`, footer tagline `\"Ruang Obat \302\267 Media Edukasi Tugas Akhir Berbasis Proyek S1 Farmasi Klinik dan Komunitas\"`, Beranda badge `\"Media Edukasi Farmasi Klinik dan Komunitas\"`.\n  3. Hide (do not delete) reviewer/lecturer elements via `src/config/appConfig.ts` (`export const SHOW_REVIEWER_TOOLS = false;`): hide Beranda PDF reviewer card, lecturer button in `Header.tsx` (keep public `\"Bagikan\"` link-sharing CTA), and `TinjauDosenModal` access (also removed `\"Untuk Claude\"` tab).\n  4. Move `public/Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf` and `public/DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.txt` out of `public/` to `docs/arsip/` (without deleting), update references, and report any other scripts/files referencing them.\n  5. PDF & reviewer modal (`generatePdfClient.ts`, `TinjauDosenModal.tsx`): `\"prototipe\"` \342\206\222 `\"pengembangan\"` (`\"DOKUMEN SPESIFIKASI PENGEMBANGAN MEDIA EDUKASI DIGITAL\"`, `\"Status Pengembangan\"`, download filename `Dokumen_Pengembangan_Ruang_Obat.pdf`), remove Bab IV `\"Evaluasi Instruksional Claude AI\"` & Claude prompt completely, adjust page count/numbering to 4 pages, replace `\"Claude\"` and `\"prototipe\"` in modal with `\"dosen pembimbing dan penguji\"` and `\"pengembangan\"`.\n  6. Keep `\"[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]\"` strings untouched inside `src/data/*`; update `RujukanText.tsx` to display calm neutral text `\"Materi sedang dalam proses validasi pakar.\"` when text starts with `\"[ISI DARI RUJUKAN\"`, and ensure all UI views/modals displaying those fields use `<RujukanText />`.\n  7. Tailwind-first styling: single font family **`Plus Jakarta Sans`** (+ `system-ui, sans-serif` fallback) for both heading & body (`DM Mono` kept for mono codes/numbers), remove `Fraunces` & `DM Sans`, body text `>= 16px`, no `text-primary` on text (`text-brand`/`text-forest`/`text-ink` only), wide dark headers/surfaces use `bg-forest`, action buttons/accents use `bg-brand` with `--on-brand`, preserve indigo/amber/emerald status & flashcard colors, `>= 44px` touch targets, clean layout at `375px` width.\n- **Strict Forbidden Boundaries**:\n  - Do NOT modify: chatbot logic (`ChatbotWidget.tsx`), `server.ts`, `server/knowledgeBase.ts`, `knowledge_books/**`, Gemini model names, or secrets/API keys.\n  - Do NOT invent/replace `\"[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]\"` strings in `src/data/*`.\n  - Report out-of-scope findings rather than fixing them silently (*\"Temuan lain cukup dilaporkan, jangan diperbaiki\"*).\n\n## 2. Progress\n- **Approval Gate Passed**: Presented complete `RINGKASAN RENCANA` and extra findings; user replied `\"Setuju\"`.\n- **Completed Code/File Changes (ALL planned implementation edits finished; build/runtime verification NOT yet run)**:\n  - **Created**:\n    - `/src/data/identitasProyek.ts`: `TIM_PENGEMBANG` (Andika Bella Pratama Putra \342\200\223 `231030790839`, Nur Abdullah Kholiq \342\200\223 `231030790829`, Syahrul Ramdhani \342\200\223 `231030791114`), `IDENTITAS_PROYEK` (`Institut Kesehatan Widya Dharma Husada Tangerang`, `S1 Farmasi Klinik dan Komunitas`, `Departemen Ilmu Farmasi Klinis \342\200\224 Website Berbasis Sistem Informasi / Media Edukasi Digital`, `Tugas Akhir Berbasis Proyek`, `2026`, `kalimatBatasan`, `statusVersi: \'Versi pengembangan 2026\'`, `taglineFooter`, `badgeBeranda`).\n    - `/src/config/appConfig.ts`: `export const SHOW_REVIEWER_TOOLS = false;`.\n  - **Moved**:\n    - `/public/Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf` \342\206\222 `/docs/arsip/Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf`\n    - `/public/DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.txt` \342\206\222 `/docs/arsip/DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.txt`\n  - **Updated (full/multi-chunk edits completed)**:\n    - `/index.html`: meta descriptions updated to `farmasi klinik dan komunitas`; Google Fonts link trimmed to `DM Mono` + `Plus Jakarta Sans` only.\n    - `/metadata.json`: description updated to `farmasi klinik dan komunitas`; `\"name\": \"Remix Ruang Obat\"` preserved.\n    - `/src/index.css`: `--font-display`, `--font-heading`, `--font-body` all set to `\'Plus Jakarta Sans\', system-ui, sans-serif`; `clamp(16px, 1.05vw, 17px)` body size preserved.\n    - `/src/components/ui/RujukanText.tsx`: renders `\"Materi sedang dalam proses validasi pakar.\"` calmly for strings starting with `\"[ISI DARI RUJUKAN\"`.\n    - `/src/components/ui/EmptyState.tsx`: replaced `text-primary` with `text-brand`.\n    - `/src/components/ui/Chip.tsx`: `min-h-[40px]` \342\206\222 `min-h-[44px]`.\n    - `/src/components/TentangModal.tsx`: uses `IDENTITAS_PROYEK`, adds `\"Tim Pengembang Website\"` section with paragraph, member names + NIMs, and prodi/institusi/year line, plus `kalimatBatasan` and `statusVersi`.\n    - `/src/components/FooterDisclaimer.tsx`: uses `IDENTITAS_PROYEK` showing `kalimatBatasan`, `taglineFooter`, member names **without NIM**, `programStudi \302\267 institusi \302\267 statusVersi`.\n    - `/src/components/Header.tsx`: gated reviewer button behind `SHOW_REVIEWER_TOOLS`; when `false`, shows public `\"Bagikan\"` button (Web Share API with clipboard fallback + `\"Tersalin!\"` feedback); updated button to `bg-brand hover:bg-forest` and `min-h-[44px]`.\n    - `/src/App.tsx`: gates `TinjauDosenModal` rendering and `onOpenTinjau` prop behind `SHOW_REVIEWER_TOOLS`.\n    - `/src/components/TinjauDosenModal.tsx`: uses `IDENTITAS_PROYEK`, removed Tab 4 (`\"Untuk Claude\"`), replaced `\"prototipe\"`/`\"skripsi\"`/`\"Claude\"`/`\"Farmasi Klinis\"` with `\"pengembangan\"`/`\"Tugas Akhir Berbasis Proyek\"`/`\"dosen pembimbing dan penguji\"`/`\"Farmasi Klinik dan Komunitas\"`, updated structure preview to 4 pages and filename `Dokumen_Pengembangan_Ruang_Obat.pdf`, updated buttons to `bg-brand` & `min-h-[44px]`.\n    - `/src/utils/generatePdfClient.ts`: uses `IDENTITAS_PROYEK`, updated title `\"DOKUMEN SPESIFIKASI PENGEMBANGAN MEDIA EDUKASI DIGITAL\"`, `\"Status Pengembangan\"`, filename `Dokumen_Pengembangan_Ruang_Obat.pdf`, removed Bab IV `\"Evaluasi Instruksional Claude AI\"` & prompt entirely (4 pages total).\n    - `/src/views/BerandaView.tsx`: updated badge to `{IDENTITAS_PROYEK.badgeBeranda}`, gated reviewer PDF card with `SHOW_REVIEWER_TOOLS && onOpenTinjau`, updated buttons to `bg-brand`, `min-h-[44px]`, and `pr-12` / `top-5 right-4` spacing for `FeatureTooltip`.\n    - `/src/views/CekLabelView.tsx`, `/src/components/KamusModal.tsx`, `/src/components/PanduanSimpanBuangModal.tsx`, `/src/views/PustakaView.tsx`: integrated `<RujukanText />` wherever `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN` data strings render (`meaning`/`tips`/`warning`, `definition`, `simpanRules`/`buangRules`/`catatanPenting`, `judul`/`tautanPlaceholder`) and enforced `min-h-[44px]`.\n    - `/src/views/LatihanView.tsx`, `/src/components/latihan/KuisModule.tsx`, `/src/components/latihan/SkenarioModule.tsx`, `/src/components/latihan/FlashcardModule.tsx`, `/src/components/RingkasanStokObatChart.tsx`, `/src/components/BerandaWalkthrough.tsx`, `/src/views/LemariView.tsx`: replaced remaining `\"skripsi\"`/`\"Skripsi\"` UI copy with `\"Tugas Akhir Berbasis Proyek\"`, aligned action CTAs to `bg-brand hover:bg-forest text-on-brand`, and updated interactive button heights to `min-h-[44px]`.\n    - `/DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.md`: updated content to official identity, team + NIM, `S1 Farmasi Klinik dan Komunitas`, `Tugas Akhir Berbasis Proyek`, `pengembangan`, removed Bab IV Claude prompt (kept root filename intact because `server/knowledgeBase.ts` reads it).\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **`server/knowledgeBase.ts` dependency**: Reads `DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.md` directly from project root (`path.join(ROOT_DIR, \'DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.md\')`), so the `.md` filename in root had to stay the same while its contents were updated.\n- **Remaining untouched/out-of-scope files (confirmed via grep earlier; re-verify in Next Steps before final report)**:\n  - `scripts/generate_pdf.mjs`: Still outputs `public/Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf` and contains old `\"Skripsi\"`, `\"Prototipe\"`, `\"Farmasi Klinis\"`, and `\"Claude AI\"` text.\n  - `src/views/LatihanPreviewView.tsx`: Unused/orphan view file not imported anywhere in `src/`; still has `\"skripsi\"` copy and `slate-`/`teal-` classes.\n  - `src/components/ChatbotWidget.tsx`: Left untouched due to `\"JANGAN mengubah: logika chatbot\"`.\n  - `docs/arsip/Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf` & `docs/arsip/DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.txt`: Preserved archived copies moved out of `public/`.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- Earlier read-only attempt using `/app/applet/src/index.css` with `view_file` failed because file tools require workspace-root `/` paths (`/src/index.css`), whereas `run_command` uses `Cwd: \"/app/applet\"`. Resolved and followed consistently afterward.\n- No edit failures or build errors encountered yet (build & lint have not been executed after Batch 1\342\200\2234 edits).\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Workspace: `/app/applet`. Dev server runs on port `3000` (`tsx server.ts`).\n- `public/` should now be empty (both `.pdf` and `.txt` moved to `/docs/arsip/`).\n- No compilation, lint, server restart, or HTTP verification has been performed yet since editing files.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. **Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` in parallel** to verify TypeScript (`tsc --noEmit`) and Vite production build succeed cleanly. Fix any compiler/type errors if found.\n2. **Inspect remaining occurrences via `run_command` (read-only audit)**:\n   - Check `/public/` is empty (`ls -la public`).\n   - Run `grep -rnE \"Claude|claude|skripsi|Skripsi|prototipe|Prototipe|Farmasi Klinis|text-primary|Fraunces|DM Sans\" src/ index.html metadata.json DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.md` to confirm zero unwanted leaks in active UI code and obtain **exact file + line numbers** of any remaining occurrences (e.g., `LatihanPreviewView.tsx` if present, `Departemen Ilmu Farmasi Klinis` in `identitasProyek.ts`, `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: Farmasi Klinis ...]` in `src/data/*`, `docs/arsip/*`, `scripts/generate_pdf.mjs`).\n3. **Restart dev server & verify live runtime behavior**:\n   - Call `restart_dev_server` so the running server picks up all changes and removed `public/` files.\n   - Verify HTTP response on `http://localhost:3000/Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf` (check status & content-type via `curl -sI http://localhost:3000/Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf` or `curl`\342\200\224note Vite SPA fallback may serve `index.html` `text/html` rather than `application/pdf`, report exact factual response!).\n   - Verify `SHOW_REVIEWER_TOOLS = false` vs `true` logic works cleanly without runtime errors, check responsive layout constraints (`375px` check / no horizontal overflow risks, `>= 44px` hit areas, `>= 16px` body font, `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN` replaced visually by `\"Materi sedang dalam proses validasi pakar.\"`).\n4. **Deliver Final Report in Formal Indonesian (`Bahasa Indonesia baku`)**:\n   - Summarize all changes made across requirements 1\342\200\2237.\n   - Explicitly list which components were updated to handle `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` (`RujukanText.tsx`, `CekLabelView.tsx`, `KamusModal.tsx`, `PanduanSimpanBuangModal.tsx`, `PustakaView.tsx`).\n   - Explicitly report remaining out-of-scope references (`scripts/generate_pdf.mjs`, `src/views/LatihanPreviewView.tsx`, `docs/arsip/*`, `server/knowledgeBase.ts`, and any `\"Claude\"` occurrences left anywhere in the repo with exact file + line numbers, noting `0` occurrences in active UI/PDF).\n   - Include factual build, lint (`tsc --noEmit`), and `/Dokumen_Prototipe_Ruang_Obat.pdf` verification results.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **User Plan Executed Strictly**: Only files approved in `RINGKASAN RENCANA` were created/moved/modified. Do NOT touch `server.ts`, `server/knowledgeBase.ts`, `knowledge_books/**`, `ChatbotWidget.tsx`, `scripts/generate_pdf.mjs`, `src/views/LatihanPreviewView.tsx`, or raw `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` strings in `src/data/*`.\n- **Language**: Formal Indonesian (`Bahasa Indonesia baku`) in final summary.\n- **Tool Rules**: Co-execute `compile_applet` + `lint_applet` on final build verification; only claim verified outputs.\n</summary>"
