    thinking: "**Observing Visuals Emerge**\n\nI\'m noticing the illustrations are exactly the warm, botanical, apothecary style I envisioned \342\200\223 cream background, sage and eucalyptus. They\'re hitting the mark. I\'m now comparing the opening experience to the user example to pinpoint areas for improvement.\n\n\n**Refining Font Choices**\n\nI\'ve been analyzing the reference images closely, specifically the font pairings. It\'s clear that the combination of `Fraunces`, `DM Sans`, and `DM Mono` is critical for achieving the desired refined aesthetic. I\'m reverting to this specific font pairing for headlines, body copy, and mono-spaced elements in the code. This directly addresses the feedback on aesthetics. I\'m prioritizing the `Fraunces` editorial serif.\n\n\n**Preserving Existing Structure**\n\nI\'m focusing now on preserving the existing structure within `TentangModal.tsx`. I need to ensure that the \"Don\'t delete\" instruction means keeping the structure intact, even if the data changes. I\'m carefully reviewing the existing sections: \"Tujuan Media Edukasi,\" \"Tim Pengembang Website,\" \"Kategori Proyek Akademik,\" \"Batasan Produk,\" and \"Kebijakan Privasi\". I\'m also ensuring the old \"Identitas Akademik\" section doesn\'t get omitted.\n\n\n**Incorporating Essential Details**\n\nI\'m now integrating crucial details. I\'ve included the complete paragraph about the final project development, along with the full developer list and structured academic metadata. I\'ve also verified that \"Batasan Produk\" still includes the specific limitations and that the \"Kebijakan Privasi (Data On-Device)\" section is preserved. Finally, I\'m ensuring that \"Tentang Ruang Obat\" remains untouched in `BerandaView.tsx` and `FooterDisclaimer.tsx`.\n\n\n**Crafting Visual Framework**\n\nI\'m now establishing the website\'s initial visual experience. I\'m focusing on the `TRODEO` layout, especially a clean horizontal kicker line, an expressive two-tone serif headline, and a \"Hero Atmosphere Container.\" This container will feature a serene, warm editorial showcase panel with botanical gradient lighting, breathing room, a pharmacy shelf illustration, and a clean 3-pillar editorial strip. The aim is to make a captivating opening.\n\n\n**Designing Summary Structure**\n\nI\'m now focusing on a 4-column KPI strip directly beneath the hero section, incorporating \"Total Obat Tercatat,\" \"Status Aman,\" \"Perlu Cek (\342\211\244 30 Hari),\" and \"Panduan Simpan & Buang.\" The goal is to create an inviting dashboard feel, inspired by the \"Hiring Timeline Tracker\" and \"Mountain Meadow\" images, using our existing color scheme and Fraunces, DM Sans fonts. I\'m prioritizing clean, tonal summary tiles and avoiding redundant cards or clutter to keep the layout calm and spacious.\n\n\n**Structuring Key Content**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the structure of major sections like \"Fitur Utama.\" I\'m implementing the editorial header rhythm from Image 3, using quiet uppercase kickers paired with crisp `Fraunces` `h2` headlines. I\'m also focusing on maintaining the compactness and functionality of `BerandaWalkthrough`, ensuring every control works and that WCAG AA contrast standards are met. I am also checking `src/views/CekLabelView.tsx`.\n\n\n"
