  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Critical Requirements**\n\nI\'ve zeroed in on two critical requirements present in both `gemini-interactions-api/SKILL.md` and `gemini-api/SKILL.md`. Specifically, the paid API key flow, which involves `show_aistudio_ui` with `ui_type: \"paid_model_flow\"`, has grabbed my attention.\n\n\n**Pinpointing Paid Key Dependency**\n\nI\'ve discovered specific models, including `gemini-nano-banana-2.1` and `gemini-omni-1.2-flash`, require a paid API key and prompt. The system instructions mandate calling `show_aistudio_ui` with the specified `ui_type` before usage. Furthermore, the `show_aistudio_ui` tool usage requires immediate cessation and response waiting after the call.\n\n**Prioritizing Reference Review**\n\nCrucially, I must thoroughly examine the `image_video_music.md` reference within the `gemini-interactions-api` directory before proceeding. I\'ve noted the imperative to call `view_file` on this reference before any implementation, as detailed in both API SKILL.md files.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "Z7QBa4bGD6Pmz7IPkoWEyQU"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_12893370238043794690"
      name: "view_file"
